    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ATLANDIS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic adventure in ATLANDIS, a top-down RPG where you create your character. Shipwrecked on island, complete your quests to escape and explore a vast world. Reach level 60 for endgame thrills: high-level spawns, token-collecting quests to summon world bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover three places: a small tutorial island, a larger island and a massive mainland. Complete long main questline. Help people in side quests. Find and solve hidden quests. Get rewarded for XP, gold, items, stat points or skill progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master skills like Sword, Dagger, Axe, Mace, Polearm, Defense, Blocking, Healing, Survival, Mining and Blacksmithing. Unlock passive abilities every 5 levels from every skill. Equip your smith hammer and use anvil to make powerful unique items, if you have blueprint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip armors (head / chest / legs / feet / hands / shield), weapon and use potions to overcome powerful dragons. Find right damage type (physical / fire / cold / poison / lightning) to destroy your enemies. Pickup loot and bring your treasures to bank to use later or sell to shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ATLANDIS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic adventure in ATLANDIS, a top-down RPG where you create your character. Shipwrecked on island, complete your quests to escape and explore a vast world. Reach level 60 for endgame thrills: high-level spawns, token-collecting quests to summon world bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover three places: a small tutorial island, a larger island and a massive mainland. Complete long main questline. Help people in side quests. Find and solve hidden quests. Get rewarded for XP, gold, items, stat points or skill progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master skills like Sword, Dagger, Axe, Mace, Polearm, Defense, Blocking, Healing, Survival, Mining and Blacksmithing. Unlock passive abilities every 5 levels from every skill. Equip your smith hammer and use anvil to make powerful unique items, if you have blueprint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip armors (head / chest / legs / feet / hands / shield), weapon and use potions to overcome powerful dragons. Find right damage type (physical / fire / cold / poison / lightning) to destroy your enemies. Pickup loot and bring your treasures to bank to use later or sell to shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
